                <pb facs="0684" n="568" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg568"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 365.117/100.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Page to the
                            Secretary of State ad interim</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-17">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 17, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>331. Department’s 261, June 14, Da Prato case. Presented yesterday personally a
                    further note to Minister Foreign Affairs and urged prompt action. He promised to
                    have matter carefully studied immediately.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy.</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
